    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffDev` is the development environment module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for development-only configuration and server composition. Shared application behavior belongs in `kickoffModules`, and server-specific runtime settings belong in child server modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Development defaults should stay overrideable and must not become framework defaults."
    }
  ],
